

### Update Post SEO

PUT http://localhost:8000/api/admin/posts/1/seo
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "meta_title": "Best AI Tools for Developers (Updated SEO)",
  "meta_description": "Updated SEO description for testing cache invalidation.",
  "canonical_url": "https://dewdora.com/posts/best-ai-tools-for-developers",
  "robots": "index,follow"
}

###

### Verify Public Post

GET http://localhost:8000/api/public/posts/best-ai-tools-for-developers
Accept: application/json

###

### Update Affiliate Product SEO

PUT http://localhost:8000/api/admin/affiliate-products/1/seo
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "meta_title": "ChatGPT Plus Review (Updated SEO)",
  "meta_description": "Updated SEO description for ChatGPT Plus.",
  "canonical_url": "https://dewdora.com/products/chatgpt-plus",
  "robots": "index,follow"
}

###

### Verify Public Product

GET http://localhost:8000/api/public/products/chatgpt-plus
Accept: application/json

###

### Delete Post SEO

DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/admin/posts/1/seo
Accept: application/json

###

### Delete Affiliate Product SEO

DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/admin/affiliate-products/1/seo
Accept: application/json